------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This project is an independent, open-source, self-hostable service that is
wire-compatible with the TypeSafe AI System One v1 API. It is not affiliated
with, sponsored by or endorsed by TypeSafe AI; "TypeSafe", "System One" and
"Jev" are used only to describe compatibility.

It optionally integrates with, but does not bundle, the following
separately-licensed model runtimes and weights:

  - Laya typed-decision runtimes ("laya-mlx", "laya-onnx") and their published
    checkpoints (Hugging Face account "aac6fef"). Downloaded on demand by
    scripts/laya-download.sh under their own licenses.
  - thenlper/gte-small sentence encoder (MIT), as the int8 ONNX export published
    at Hugging Face "Xenova/gte-small". Downloaded on demand at a pinned revision
    by scripts/embed-download.sh; not included in this repository.
  - Laya checkpoints: convaiinnovations/laya and aac6fef/laya-mlx,
    aac6fef/laya-multilingual-mlx are published under Apache-2.0.

External LLM providers (OpenAI, xAI, Anthropic) are used only when you supply a
provider API key; they are governed by their respective terms.

